    "body": "> Let me know when you have a second implementer interested, and then we can merge.\r\n\r\nYes, I''ve got some informal support from @jgraham during a meeting to review the WPT [RFC](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/rfcs/pull/121) , but I agree we should wait until we got explicit support in the position request. There is also an ongoing conversation in the Firefox [bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1788789) I've filed, but again still not clear support there either.\r\n",
